Will forever be funny Did you knoe Adam Sandler shows up at the very end of Nelly’s “Errtime” video. The song dropped March 15, 2005 off The Longest Yard soundtrack. Nelly, Jung Tru, and King Jacob. Produced by Jazze Pha. It was the main record tied to the remake that had Nelly, Chris Rock, and Sandler in the same movie. It peaked at No. 24 on the Billboard Hot 100, No. 59 on Hot R&B/Hip-Hop, No. 27 on the Pop 100. S. Charted overseas too , No.

